  "statement": "I approve proposal sha256:76f14ae25cff7840d0028be1ca0af87bbf325178d99a5ca2b80806aa3ddb2c73 at commit 1845be6c852654c8396f2973981733ce64a3d2d0 for one single-use zero-spend execution. Preserve the existing Google project, OAuth client, consent configuration, Google client ID, and Cloudflare R2 credentials. Create exactly one new Google client secret without raw output, securely replace and verify only GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET, then revoke only the exposed old secret. Remove exactly one trailing newline from R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID and R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY without any Cloudflare mutation, and refresh the exact secret-free receipt. No other changes, retries, redispatch, RunPod calls, GPU use, or spend are authorized. Stop on any ambiguity, drift, or raw-secret exposure."
